description:
**File:** `src/main.rs` — `parse_cli_with_suggestions()` (~line 237)

**Evidence:** `testaruda select --help` prints a garbled suggestion:
```
💡 Unknown command 's internal iteration order
   - deterministic: Byte-stable ordering…
   Did you mean 'status'?
```

**Fix:** Check the clap error kind before attempting extraction:
```rust
use clap::error::ErrorKind;
Err(err) => {
    if matches!(err.kind(), ErrorKind::DisplayHelp | ErrorKind::DisplayVersion | ErrorKind::DisplayHelpOnMissingArgumentOrSubcommand) {
        err.exit();
    }
    // … existing suggestion logic
}
```
